WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.051 --> 00:00:04.584
[ Piano music - begins and continues throughout the video ]

00:00:04.584 --> 00:00:17.424
[Piano music continues]

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.612
[Gene Kelly] I told you over and over again&nbsp;
for God's sake, I felt glad,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:21.612 --> 00:00:23.930
glad I was out of that ship.

00:00:23.930 --> 00:00:26.705
[Male voice - off camera] Is that all?     [Gene Kelly] Yes. Yes! Yes.

00:00:26.705 --> 00:00:37.120
[Piano music continues]

00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:41.209
[Cartoon character #1 - male voice] The smoke from your factory, it's destroying&nbsp;my home, my my health my &nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:41.209 --> 00:00:44.324
[Cartoon character #2 - male voice] We too are concerned about that pressing problem. 

00:00:44.324 --> 00:00:47.736
Here, let me&nbsp;
show you some of our ads on air pollution.

00:00:48.046 --> 00:00:55.932
[Piano music continues]

00:00:57.098 --> 00:01:02.787
[Young woman] All these your babies Miss Mary?
[Older woman] Yes, these are all my babies.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:02.787 --> 00:01:07.986
Delivered about 1400, counting the ones come this year.

00:01:07.986 --> 00:01:15.360
[Piano music continues]

00:01:15.360 --> 00:01:23.945
[Narrator] It was Louis Pasteur who smashed the belief&nbsp;
that microbes came into existence by spontaneous&nbsp;generation.&nbsp;

00:01:23.945 --> 00:01:29.582
His opponents shouted and ranted&nbsp;
against him but he performed his experiments

00:01:29.582 --> 00:01:34.159
and silenced the unbelievers with indisputable facts.&nbsp;

00:01:34.159 --> 00:01:40.101
[Piano music continues]

00:01:40.101 --> 00:01:42.433
[Female actor speaking in scene] ... raining so long there's dust in the road. 

00:01:42.433 --> 00:01:47.237
[Female actor speaks off camera] some of it got in my throat.  I won't&nbsp;have you worry about me.

00:01:47.237 --> 00:01:50.543
[Female actor speaking in scene]  I'm all right [she coughs]

00:01:51.068 --> 00:01:54.271
[Female voice speaks off camera] ... it's late, you have to get up early to go to work.

00:01:54.271 --> 00:02:01.760
[Piano music continues]

00:02:01.760 --> 00:02:05.920
[Young man speaks off camera] ... and I read this case history of&nbsp;
this guy who had had pneumonia&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:05.920 --> 00:02:08.492
and every symptom that he had I had.&nbsp;
&nbsp;

00:02:08.492 --> 00:02:16.448
[Young man] I went straight to my doctor and he&nbsp;diagnosed me as having pneumonia and AIDS,&nbsp;virtually there in his office on the spot.

00:02:16.448 --> 00:02:27.520
[Piano music continues]

00:02:27.520 --> 00:02:32.400
[President Roosevelt] For we cannot be a strong nation&nbsp;
unless we are a healthy nation&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:32.400 --> 00:02:39.811
and so we must recruit not only men and&nbsp;
materials but also knowledge and science.

00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:52.082
[Piano music continues]

00:02:52.554 --> 00:02:56.634
[Piano music fades into silence]

